    <node id="&quot;CHRISTMAS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Christmas is a festive holiday celebrated by the Cratchit family, symbolizing joy, togetherness, and the spirit of giving."&lt;SEP&gt;"Christmas is a festive occasion that brings the Cratchit family together, symbolizing joy and togetherness despite their hardships."&lt;SEP&gt;"Christmas is a festive season characterized by themes of family, joy, and warmth, prominently featured in Scrooge's memories."&lt;SEP&gt;"Christmas is a holiday celebrated in the story, marked by family gatherings, games, and the spirit of generosity and goodwill."&lt;SEP&gt;"Christmas is an occasion where memories of joy, gifts, and family are brought to the forefront, highlighting Scrooge's loneliness and regrets during this time."&lt;SEP&gt;"Christmas is depicted as a time of goodwill, charity, and warmth, which conflicts with Scrooge's views of it as a burden."&lt;SEP&gt;"Christmas is depicted as a time of joy and celebration, around which many of the narrative's emotions and themes revolve."&lt;SEP&gt;"Christmas is depicted as a time of joy and celebration, influencing various characters' behaviors and thoughts in the narrative."&lt;SEP&gt;"Christmas is portrayed as a festive and cheerful occasion filled with various traditional activities and symbols."&lt;SEP&gt;"Christmas is portrayed as a time of celebration and joy, which Scrooge sees only as an inconvenience and a financial burden."&lt;SEP&gt;"Christmas is presented as a festive season during which characters like Fezziwig engage in joyful celebrations and gatherings."&lt;SEP&gt;"Christmas is the central theme of the text, representing a time of kindness, family gatherings, and the spirit of giving."&lt;SEP&gt;"Christmas is the festive season being discussed, a time when generosity and compassion towards the needy are emphasized, contrasting sharply with Scrooge's attitude."&lt;SEP&gt;"Christmas represents a time of celebration and goodwill, as well as a significant theme in Scrooge's transformation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Christmas represents a time of joy and family gatherings, and is a focal point of the discussion surrounding Scrooge's behavior and outlook."&lt;SEP&gt;"Christmas serves as a pivotal backdrop for the narrative, evoking memories, transformation, and emotional connections in Scrooge's life."&lt;SEP&gt;"Christmas serves as the backdrop for Scrooge's transformation and acts as a catalyst for his changed outlook on life."&lt;SEP&gt;"Christmas symbolizes a time of goodwill, reflection, and change, as embodied by Scrooge's transformation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-89777b838d5447c7bd1ec11282c4ee89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74e2466de2f67fd710ef2f20c0a8d9e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6c248858d1b13ab7ee9ca13c1aeed6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-503f0bfa5453467c7c61d160a3540eca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43c9bee23adfa77aa9dedd22401bba7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94bea83e7153fc2064aa382b494936a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-773d0df1dd25c356f7b771d780583e09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d4b58de5429cd1261370c231c8673e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5dac41b3f9eeaf794f0147400b1718cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8590d9263cd2cd4fa583c432fc54e6c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7637ff18c5ded77a68cce0a87883fad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99b0ec7f7e006561352b5d65e849611d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da2472b4ef2a535b62908f14d0fb0ca9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91614df5cb74cbe5e109a338a82041e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91572b3cd42786ba4cb2f180ca25cbf4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90d5764e301321c087f5a8f78b73a145&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54bdd22db1f84a965b5f4c06c9216d8d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f738cb25d60a7dab782162d9d0a25ed</data>
