      <data key="d1">"The Bell is an object that signals strange happenings in the house, playing a role in the supernatural events experienced by Scrooge."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Bell signifies the measuring of time and the events awaiting Scrooge, such as the arrival of the Spirits."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Bell signifies the passage of time and the significance of moments leading to reflection and transformation in Scrooge's journey."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Bell tolls as a marker of time, signifying the moments of change and the supernatural awakening Scrooge experiences."</data>
