    <node id="&quot;BOB CRATCHIT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Bob Cratchit is Scrooge's clerk, living modestly with his family, and is portrayed as a figure of warmth and familial love despite financial struggles."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bob Cratchit is Scrooge's clerk, portrayed as a kind-hearted individual who, despite his low wages and Scrooge's grumbling, looks forward to Christmas."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bob Cratchit is Scrooge's employee, depicted as a hardworking individual who is often late but is also a family man, representing the struggles of the working class."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bob Cratchit is a caring father figure in the story who reflects on the nature of kindness and the memory of Tiny Tim, a little child."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bob Cratchit is a character who represents the struggling working class, facing hardships while caring for his family, including Tiny Tim."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bob Cratchit is a character who works for Scrooge, symbolizing the struggles of the less fortunate and receiving a gift from Scrooge as part of his transformation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bob Cratchit is a clerk to Ebenezer Scrooge and represents the struggles of the working class, embodying the spirit of Christmas."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bob Cratchit is a devoted father and husband, who expresses love for his family and concerns for Tiny Tim's health."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bob Cratchit is a father who seeks to bring joy to his family despite their struggles, showing deep care for his children and strong emotions related to his son Tiny Tim."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bob Cratchit is a mild and gentle character who acknowledges Mr. Scrooge's role as 'the Founder of the Feast' and expresses a desire to toast Scrooge for the sake of Christmas."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bob Cratchit is the father figure in the Cratchit family, described as caring and supportive, often concerned about his children, especially Tiny Tim."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-90b95db5c53e4364a6bee36b7aa4d70f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-503f0bfa5453467c7c61d160a3540eca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94bea83e7153fc2064aa382b494936a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9aac3484185ac66045df92214d245d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d4b58de5429cd1261370c231c8673e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0f459f5af1c3a5e0b92cbe4ee48b77b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e3921da66da5d761ab73cd849af6c43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19d72c57ae3408758b18d2568e86dc6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83ac129dc9b56f84c46760d153d68e93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e2e7ebcc19a53b399dc03aded4743e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91572b3cd42786ba4cb2f180ca25cbf4</data>
    </node>
