    <node id="&quot;THE GHOST&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Ghost is a manifestation that represents a spirit or supernatural being, guiding Scrooge through visions to teach him valuable lessons about life and death."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ghost is a spiritual entity that accompanies Scrooge, teaching him lessons about compassion, generosity, and human suffering."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ghost is a supernatural figure guiding Scrooge through his memories, representing reflections on his past and the impact of his choices."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ghost is an ethereal figure that interacts with Scrooge, serving as a catalyst for his introspection and change during Christmas."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ghost represents a spectral entity that serves as a guide for Scrooge, warning him through messages about his life choices and consequences."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ghost represents a spectral force that reveals to Scrooge the painful truths of his past, urging him to confront his regrets."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ghost represents the spectral beings that guide Scrooge through his reflections and lessons learned about his life choices."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ghost symbolizes the spirits of the deceased, representing remorse and the lessons one learns after death."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c6c248858d1b13ab7ee9ca13c1aeed6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8590d9263cd2cd4fa583c432fc54e6c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83ac129dc9b56f84c46760d153d68e93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7637ff18c5ded77a68cce0a87883fad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da2472b4ef2a535b62908f14d0fb0ca9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb661c37436355ccec2769b1d0350c5f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54bdd22db1f84a965b5f4c06c9216d8d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-359187e7571bda4b0b08b2e0b6581e52</data>
