    <node id="&quot;MRS. CRATCHIT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mrs. Cratchit is Bob's wife, portrayed as nurturing and supportive, contributing to the family's emotional strength."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mrs. Cratchit is Bob's wife, who manages the household and prepares the Christmas meal with care, symbolizing resilience and spirit."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mrs. Cratchit is Bob's wife, who manages the household and supports her husband and children during difficult times."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mrs. Cratchit is Bob's wife, who prepares the Christmas pudding and is proud of her culinary achievements for the family dinner."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mrs. Cratchit is a vocal and spirited character who expresses disdain for Mr. Scrooge, highlighting his odious reputation among the family."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mrs. Cratchit is the mother of the Cratchit family, depicted as nurturing and caring, often busy with household tasks and looking after her children."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mrs. Cratchit is the wife of Bob Cratchit, representing the difficulties faced by families during the holiday season while embodying love and care."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-503f0bfa5453467c7c61d160a3540eca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d4b58de5429cd1261370c231c8673e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0f459f5af1c3a5e0b92cbe4ee48b77b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e3921da66da5d761ab73cd849af6c43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19d72c57ae3408758b18d2568e86dc6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e2e7ebcc19a53b399dc03aded4743e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91572b3cd42786ba4cb2f180ca25cbf4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THE GIRL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Girl is depicted as a beautiful young figure with whom Scrooge has a past connection, reflecting his lost opportunities for love."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Girl, alongside Ignorance, symbolizes the consequences of humanity's failings and the dire need for compassion and understanding."&lt;SEP&gt;"The girl is a minor character who assists Scrooge in finding his nephew, representing the kindness and helpfulness of people."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e7637ff18c5ded77a68cce0a87883fad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54bdd22db1f84a965b5f4c06c9216d8d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f738cb25d60a7dab782162d9d0a25ed</data>
