      <data key="d1">"Peter Cratchit is Bob and Mrs. Cratchit's son, who enjoys the holiday cheer and takes pride in his appearance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Peter Cratchit is a young boy in the Cratchit family, who exhibits youthful innocence and camaraderie with his siblings as they support their father."&lt;SEP&gt;"Peter Cratchit is one of Bob Cratchit's sons, who shows a sense of maturity and responsibility towards his family."&lt;SEP&gt;"Peter Cratchit is one of the Cratchit children, who reflects on potential employment opportunities while engaging with his family during Christmas time."</data>
