    <node id="&quot;FRED&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Fred is Scrooge's cheerful and optimistic nephew, who embodies the festive spirit that Scrooge initially disdains."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fred is Scrooge's nephew who expresses admiration for his uncle and offers a toast to him during the Christmas gathering."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fred is Scrooge's nephew, who expresses surprise and joy at seeing Scrooge at the family dinner, indicating a warm familial relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fred is Scrooge's nephew, who invites Scrooge to join the Christmas dinner, representing familial warmth and holiday spirit."</data>
