    <node id="&quot;THE CRATCHIT FAMILY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Cratchit Family consists of Bob, Mrs. Cratchit, Tiny Tim, and their children, showcasing the dynamics of a loving but struggling household."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Cratchit Family consists of Bob, his wife, and their children, characterized by their struggles yet strong familial bonds and love for each other."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Cratchit Family embodies warmth and gratitude despite their poverty, contrasting with the cold character of Mr. Scrooge."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Cratchit Family is a close-knit family that exemplifies love, warmth, and resilience during Christmas, despite their financial hardships."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Cratchit Family is a representation of a struggling family united in love, despite their financial and emotional difficulties."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Cratchit Family represents a loving and supportive unit, demonstrating resilience and unity in the face of hardship, particularly in the care for Tiny Tim."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-1d4b58de5429cd1261370c231c8673e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0f459f5af1c3a5e0b92cbe4ee48b77b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19d72c57ae3408758b18d2568e86dc6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83ac129dc9b56f84c46760d153d68e93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e2e7ebcc19a53b399dc03aded4743e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91572b3cd42786ba4cb2f180ca25cbf4</data>
    </node>
