      <data key="d1">"Scrooge's Nephew is a cheerful and optimistic character who represents the spirit of Christmas, trying to engage Scrooge in festive conversation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Scrooge's Nephew is a jovial character who embodies the spirit of Christmas, expressing joy and attempting to engage his uncle, Scrooge, in merriment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Scrooge's Nephew is a lively character who plays games and represents the spirit of joy and love during Christmas gatherings."&lt;SEP&gt;"Scrooge's Nephew is portrayed as a kind and hopeful character, advocating for the spirit of Christmas despite Scrooge's objections."</data>
