    <node id="&quot;HOPE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Hope is a key theme illustrating the possibility of positive outcomes even in the bleakest situations, as seen in Caroline's reaction to the news."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hope represents the aspiration or desire for a better future, which plays a key role in the characters' motivations and choices."</data>
