    <node id="&quot;JACOB MARLEY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Jacob Marley is Scrooge's deceased friend who appears as a ghost to warn Scrooge about his fate and the importance of change."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jacob Marley is Scrooge's former business partner, now a ghost who intervenes in Scrooge's life to warn him of impending doom."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jacob Marley is a deceased character whose past relationship with Scrooge plays a significant role in Scrooge's transformation during the Christmas season."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jacob Marley is a deceased character whose prediction about Scrooge foreshadows the warnings and lessons Scrooge must learn from the Spirits."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jacob Marley is a ghost representing the consequences of Scrooge's past actions and serves as a catalyst for his transformation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jacob Marley is a spirit who appears to Scrooge, inspiring him to embrace the Christmas spirit and reflect on his past, present, and future."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jacob Marley is the Ghost who appears to Scrooge, revealing the burdens of his past and the importance of compassion and charity."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jacob Marley is the deceased business partner of Scrooge, whose ghost returns to express remorse and warn Scrooge about his life choices."</data>
