    <edge source="&quot;CHRISTMAS&quot;" target="&quot;SCROOGE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">110.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Scrooge expresses contempt for Christmas, seeing it as a time filled with burdens rather than joy."&lt;SEP&gt;"Scrooge learns to embrace the true meaning of Christmas, evolving from a miser to someone who embodies the spirit of giving."&lt;SEP&gt;"Scrooge rejects the festive spirit of Christmas, viewing it as a burden instead of a celebration."&lt;SEP&gt;"Scrooge's attitude toward Christmas highlights his isolation from familial joy, creating a sharp contrast with his relatives who celebrate the holiday."&lt;SEP&gt;"Scrooge's change is closely tied to the celebration of Christmas, marking a pivotal change in his character and mindset."&lt;SEP&gt;"Scrooge's emotional transformation is closely linked to his reflections on Christmas and his past experiences during this holiday."&lt;SEP&gt;"Scrooge's experiences during Christmas serve as a turning point in his character development and understanding of joy."&lt;SEP&gt;"Scrooge's experiences highlight the transformation associated with the Christmas spirit and celebration."&lt;SEP&gt;"Scrooge's journey is deeply intertwined with the themes of Christmas, as he learns its meaning through the Ghost's teachings."&lt;SEP&gt;"Scrooge's negative attitude towards Christmas highlights a personal conflict with the season's themes of generosity and kindness."&lt;SEP&gt;"Scrooge's reflections on Christmas highlight its significance as a time of family and joy, contrasting with his current state."&lt;SEP&gt;"Scrooge's transformation throughout the narrative relates to his understanding of Christmas and its importance."</data>
      <data key="d5">"celebration, transformation"&lt;SEP&gt;"conflict, seasonal themes"&lt;SEP&gt;"holiday spirit, personal transformation"&lt;SEP&gt;"isolation, festive contrast"&lt;SEP&gt;"nostalgia, holiday spirit"&lt;SEP&gt;"opposition, holiday spirit"&lt;SEP&gt;"rejection, holiday critique"&lt;SEP&gt;"thematic significance, transformation"&lt;SEP&gt;"transformation, celebration"&lt;SEP&gt;"transformation, emotional reflection"&lt;SEP&gt;"transformation, holiday significance"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-c6c248858d1b13ab7ee9ca13c1aeed6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74e2466de2f67fd710ef2f20c0a8d9e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-773d0df1dd25c356f7b771d780583e09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94bea83e7153fc2064aa382b494936a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5dac41b3f9eeaf794f0147400b1718cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8590d9263cd2cd4fa583c432fc54e6c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7637ff18c5ded77a68cce0a87883fad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99b0ec7f7e006561352b5d65e849611d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da2472b4ef2a535b62908f14d0fb0ca9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91614df5cb74cbe5e109a338a82041e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90d5764e301321c087f5a8f78b73a145&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f738cb25d60a7dab782162d9d0a25ed</data>
