      <data key="d4">"The Charwoman’s involvement with The Stolen Goods exemplifies her self-interest and disregard for ethical standards."</data>
      <data key="d5">"self-interest, ethics"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-60fc063c79fc0d4acc91a57e79de04dc</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;THE IDOL&quot;" target="&quot;SCROOGE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Scrooge grapples with the concept of The Idol, which symbolizes his materialistic pursuits over genuine human connections."</data>
      <data key="d5">"materialism, conflict"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-b2f98bc7abb0c67d4c86055c7fd72218</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;THE LAUNDRESS&quot;" target="&quot;THE BUNDLE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Laundress's contributions to The Bundle illustrate her complicity in the act of stealing from the deceased."</data>
      <data key="d5">"theft, complicity"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-60fc063c79fc0d4acc91a57e79de04dc</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DEATH&quot;" target="&quot;SCROOGE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">15.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Scrooge contemplates the presence of Death and its implications for humanity, particularly in relation to his own life."&lt;SEP&gt;"Scrooge’s reflections on death reveal his internal struggle with consequences of his past actions and the potential for redemption."</data>
      <data key="d5">"existential contemplation, life choices"&lt;SEP&gt;"reflection, potential change"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-e1f29eeadc1d8ab46dc8a0bbd3c56b64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83ac129dc9b56f84c46760d153d68e93</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;THE ROOM OF DEATH&quot;" target="&quot;SCROOGE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Scrooge's visit to the room of death triggers profound reflections on his life choices and their consequences."</data>
      <data key="d5">"reflection, mortality"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-83ac129dc9b56f84c46760d153d68e93</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SCROOGE&quot;" target="&quot;THE PHANTOMS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Scrooge's encounter with the Phantoms represents his confrontation with the consequences of his past actions."</data>
      <data key="d5">"confrontation, consequences"</data>
